#: scenario3:scenario3_72DD4588_D919_4D40_BBCF_10DF9071DC19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d998f78950fc676122a8ca150d074b114aada88196cc6dce6131bf6bc343617
